                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muyooziba kuti ndime Jehova, ciindi eco bajayidwe babo nibanoozoolede akati kazikozyano zyabo cakuzyunguluka zipaililo zyabo, atala azilundu zyoonse zilamfu, amitwe yoonse yamalundu, mucenzule camisamu yoonse mitete, kunsi lyamibanga yoonse iivovwene, mumasena oonse nkubakali kucitila mizimu yabo tusamu twatununkilizyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.13"
            ]
          }
